	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Cęsar est mendax et pater eius.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Promisit nescio quid, quod pertineat ad pacem <lb xml:id="p1z2"/><placeName ref="l822">Germanię</placeName> in religione, et nunc definit, ubi tam quidem horrenda conspiciuntur, ut <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>concilium magis horrendum quid nec invenire nec definire possit.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Sed hęc nosti.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z4"/>Equidem non video nisi persecutionem futuram.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Huc itaque paremus oportet corpora nostra, <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>ut queant esse fictimę gratę domino.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Is conferat gratiam et auxilium, ut in die malo <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>per patientiam et liberam Christi domini confessionem possimus stare ac perdurare in his, <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>quę ex verbo divino hactenus et docuimus et pro virili exercuimus.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Amen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z8"/>Rumor huc devenit papam scripsisse ad <placeName ref="l862">Helvetios</placeName> ac petiisse auxilia tanto <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>studio, ut hactenus nunquam sic petierit; non filios vocarit, sed patres ac <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>defensores ecclesię promiseritque tanta bona, quanta possit sanctitas ipsius conferre; <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>hostem autem esse Cęsarem, cuius conatus sit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Italiam facere suam.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Velim nosse, num <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>quid hic veri sit.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z13"/>Rumor alius: <persName ref="p8112">Gallum</persName> tentasse <placeName ref="l322">Metim</placeName> occupare sub praetextu supplicationum;<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a">Mitgeteilt von Rainer Henrich im August 2014: In Brief 18126 (Satz 25ff.) ist von einem angeblichen <placeName ref="l832">französischen</placeName> Anschlag auf <placeName ref="l322">Metz</placeName> die Rede. Was <persName ref="p8418">Myconius</persName> wiedergibt, ist nur ein Gerücht, doch gibt es immerhin einen realen Hintergrund, genauer gesagt: einige Beschuldigte, denen später der Prozess gemacht wurde. Für die Kommentierung lohnt sich ein Blick in: Gaston Zeller, La réunion de Metz à la France (1552-1648), Bd. 1, S. 276ff. (ZB: TK 209:ag).</note> misit <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>enim ingentem vim hominum in civitatem, et nisi per proditorem quendam res esset facta palam, <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>aliquid fuisset actum; nam et in civitate fuerunt proditionis conscii.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Mox igitur <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>et primatibus quatuor capti sunt et suppliciis adfecti, quorum capita perticis imposita <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>et in altum erecta vidit auriga, qui hęc narravit.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Qui in supplicationibus <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>fuerunt, adhuc detinentur in civitate.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Bellum divinant itaque futurum, nisi <persName ref="p8112">Gallus</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>velit suos iri perditum.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Equidem hic secundum carnem: "Quicquid accidat, quod evocet <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>Cęsarem aliquando ex <placeName ref="l822">Germania</placeName> et aliud interim superveniat ipsius Interim, gratum <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>esse mihi posset."</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z22"/>Responderunt <placeName ref="l491">Argentinenses</placeName> Cęsari volentes adhuc, ut confessio sua maneat <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>inviolata.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Quid ille sit responsurus, expectant.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Orandus est dominus, ut tueatur verbum <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>suum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/><persName ref="p3099">Sultzerus</persName> hic hęret etiamnum propter uxorem, quę <placeName ref="l28">Basiliensis</placeName> est.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Quid de eo <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>sit futurum, nescio.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Beatus venit nudiustertius, hodie cum familia et suppelectili <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>descendit <placeName ref="l491">Argentinam</placeName>, unde et uxor ortum habet.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z28"/>uid eras his tuis adiunctas e vestigio mittas <placeName ref="l257">Constantiam</placeName> ad dominum <persName ref="p8055">Ambrosium</persName>; quid <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>contineant, nescio, sed opus video, ne diutius in itinere morentur.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Quęso te, ut <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>diligenter rem, id quod et hactenus in paribus fecisti, cures.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Titulum seu super<lb xml:id="p1z31"/>scriptionem plane negligas.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">Mitte caute.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z32"/>Misit ad nos dominus <persName ref="p8127">Pellicanus</persName> <persName ref="p8184">Valentinum</persName><note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1"><persName ref="p8184">Boltz</persName>.</note> quendam ex <placeName ref="l176">Glareana</placeName>, qui sic perturbat <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>ecclesię nostrę ordinem, ut non sit opus alio perturbatore.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Non audivi hominem, <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>quocirca iudicare non possum de ipso.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la">Sic pellicit tamen homines, ut nemo non velit <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>audire.</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la">Audierunt fratres mei fere omnes et i dicant virum nec doctum nec <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>per omnia sanum; invehitur in quoslibet sine pudore excepta plebe; hanc nescio <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>qua ratione mirabiliter adlicit.</s>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la">Pessimi quiquam adeunt, ut auscultent; hinc reli<lb xml:id="p1z38"/>qui stupent dicentes: "Ecce et ille audit; oportet igitur esse hominem magnum et <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>admirabilem."</s>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la">Magistratus plebi tantum non adsentit, atque inde turbatus est omnium parochi<lb xml:id="p1z40"/>arum optimus ordo.</s>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la">Hęc tibi in sinum.</s>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="la">Velim tamen, si hominem nosses, eum mihi <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>describeres.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="35" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale in Chrsto cum fratribus omnibus, im primis <persName ref="p8011">Gvalthero</persName> et <persName ref="p8127">Pęellicano</persName>.</s>
					<s n="36" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z42"/>Vellem illis scribere; sed adeo debilitatus sum ex morbo, ut digitos difficulter <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>moveam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="37" xml:lang="la">Literas has, quęso, cures diligenter.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="38" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l28">Basileę</placeName> 7. iunii anno 1548.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="39" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z44"/>T(uus) <persName ref="p8418">O(svaldus) M(yc<pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>onius)</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="40" xml:lang="la">D. <persName ref="p495">Heinricho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>in domino suo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
